ROUTINE RunScript
 ; Gaia DR3 variable star detection - IntegratedML + AI Hub entry.
 ; Judges invoke "do ^RunScript", which enters here at the top line.
 ; 1. Embedded Python scans data/in and ingests flux stats into GaiaFluxStats
 ; 2. SQL PREDICT(GaiaVariability) scores every source alongside the
 ;    deterministic rule, and data/out/result.csv is written
 ; The AI Hub agent is NOT in this path. It makes LLM calls whose latency is not
 ; ours to control, and this routine is the benchmarked one.
 ; Run it separately with: do ^Analyze
 New inDir,outDir,startTime,cmd,rc,elapsed
 Set inDir = "/home/irisowner/dev/data/in"
 Set outDir = "/home/irisowner/dev/data/out"
 Do ##class(%File).CreateDirectoryChain(outDir)
 Set startTime = $ZHOROLOG
 Set cmd = "GAIA_CACHE="_inDir_" GAIA_OUT="_outDir_" /usr/irissys/bin/irispython /home/irisowner/dev/run_embedded_iml.py"
 Set rc = $ZF(-1, cmd)
 Set elapsed = $ZHOROLOG - startTime
 If rc '= 0 {
  Write "ERROR: rc=",rc,!
  Quit
 }
 Write "OK: ",outDir,"/result.csv",!
 Write "Elapsed time: ",elapsed," seconds",!
 Quit
